graphify-out/

# Claude Code: live session lock, not project config
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# ─── Real BVD invoice data ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real per-driver, per-transaction financial data (who bought how much
# fuel, where, when, for how much). Git history is permanent and repo
# visibility is one misclick — this never gets committed, private repo or
# not. Place real invoices in backend/test/fixtures/invoices/ locally —
# the real-invoice describe blocks pick them up from there and skip
# automatically when the file is absent (see e.g. parseInvoiceCsv.test.ts).
backend/test/fixtures/invoices/*.csv
backend/test/fixtures/invoices/*.pdf
backend/test/fixtures/invoices/*.PROVENANCE.md

# Exception: a synthetic, redacted fixture may be committed so the
# structural assertions can run on a fresh clone or in CI.
!backend/test/fixtures/invoices/sample-redacted.csv
!backend/test/fixtures/invoices/sample-redacted.pdf
!backend/test/fixtures/invoices/README.md
